---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Shop — Dekoris"
pageDescription: "Shop Dekoris's premium blinds and curtains — Honeycomb, Roller, Zebra, Roman, Venetian, and more. Proudly Namibian."
activePage: shop
permalink: /shop/
---
  <style>
    .shop-intro {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 80px 40px 32px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .shop-intro-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .shop-intro .section-label {
      justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .shop-intro h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: var(--type-h1);
      font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-dark);
      line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .shop-intro p {
      font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-body);
      line-height: 1.7; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .shop-section { background: var(--white); padding: 40px 40px 100px; }
    .shop-grid {
      max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 40px 28px;
    }
    /* ── Editorial cards ── */
    .ed-card { display: block; text-align: center; }
    .ed-card .ed-media { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .ed-card .ed-media img {
      width: 100%; height: 320px; object-fit: cover; display: block;
      transition: transform 0.55s ease;
    }
    .ed-card:hover .ed-media img { transform: scale(1.04); }
    .ed-quick {
      position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: -46px;
      background: rgba(84,84,84,0.92); color: var(--white);
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 13px; transition: bottom 0.25s ease;
    }
    .ed-card:hover .ed-quick { bottom: 0; }
    /* Touch devices have no hover — keep the button visible */
    @media (hover: none) {
      .ed-quick { bottom: 0; }
    }
    .ed-title {
      font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 2.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-dark); font-weight: 600; margin: 18px 0 6px;
    }
    .ed-price { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-light); }
    .ed-dots { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 10px; min-height: 20px; }
    .ed-dots i {
      width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 3px;
      background-size: cover; background-position: center;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); display: inline-block;
    }
    .ed-dots em { font-style: normal; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 20px; }
    .ed-badges { margin-top: 8px; }
    .ed-badges span {
      font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold-dark); border: 1px solid var(--gold-light, #d8cdb6);
      border-radius: 2px; padding: 2px 8px; margin: 0 2px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .shop-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .shop-section { padding: 32px 24px 80px; }
      .shop-intro { padding: 64px 24px 24px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .shop-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .ed-card .ed-media img { height: 280px; }
    }
    .shop-footnote {
      max-width: 720px; margin: 64px auto 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-light);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .shop-footnote a { color: var(--gold); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold-light); }
    .shop-footnote a:hover { color: var(--gold-dark); }
  </style>

  <section class="shop-intro">
    <div class="shop-intro-inner">
      <div class="section-label">Shop</div>
      <h1>Crafted for every window.</h1>
      <p>Choose your product, fabric, colour and size — your order becomes a free quote request. We measure, confirm and install. Pricing shown is a starting point from the 600 × 1000 mm size.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shop-section">
    <div class="shop-grid">
      {% for product in collections.products %}
      <a class="ed-card fade-up" href="/shop/{{ product.data.slug }}/" style="transition-delay: {{ loop.index0 * 0.05 }}s">
        <div class="ed-media">
          <img src="{{ product.data.image }}" alt="{{ product.data.title }}">
          <div class="ed-quick">Choose Options</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ed-title">{{ product.data.title }}</div>
        {% if product.data.priceNote %}
        <div class="ed-price">{{ product.data.priceNote }}</div>
        {% else %}
        <div class="ed-price">from N${{ product.data.price | commaNumber }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="ed-dots">
          {% if product.data.fabricTypes %}
            {% set cols = product.data.fabricTypes[0].colours %}
            {% set n = cols.length %}
            {% for c in cols %}
              {% if n <= 5 or ((loop.index0 * 5) // n) > (((loop.index0 - 1) * 5) // n) %}<i title="{{ c.code }} · {{ c.name }}" style="background-color: {{ c.hex }}{% if c.swatch %}; background-image: url('{{ c.swatch }}'){% endif %}"></i>{% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
            {% set total = 0 %}
            {% for ft in product.data.fabricTypes %}{% set total = total + ft.colours.length %}{% endfor %}
            {% if total > 5 %}<em>+{{ total - 5 }}</em>{% endif %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if product.data.slug != "curtains" %}
        <div class="ed-badges">
          <span>No-Drill</span>
          {% if product.data.motorised %}<span>Motorised</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="shop-footnote">
      Looking for something custom or want measurements done for you?
      <a href="/quote/">Request a quote</a> and we'll be in touch within 1-2 business days.
    </p>
  </section>

<!-- Cart drawer is included site-wide via base.njk -->
